        "id": "572746",
        "title": "Dual Spotlight",
        "difficulty": "easy",
        "description": "<p>In the Virtual Stage&ndash;Online Academy crossover, spotlighted performers often deepen their craft by taking related courses. The director wants to find artists who both starred in &ldquo;Magic&rdquo; shows and enrolled in &ldquo;Magic&rdquo; courses, to feature them in a special masterclass.</p>\n<p>You are given two tables: &lsquo;performances&rsquo; and &lsquo;enrollments&rsquo;.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The &lsquo;performances&rsquo; table contains &lsquo;performance_id&rsquo;, &lsquo;actor_name&rsquo;, and &lsquo;show_title&rsquo;. Each row logs one live theatrical performance.</li>\n<li>The &lsquo;enrollments&rsquo; table contains &lsquo;enrollment_id&rsquo;, &lsquo;student_name&rsquo;, and &lsquo;course_title&rsquo;. Each row records one online course signup.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"385\" data-end=\"401\">Your task is to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"405\" data-end=\"495\">Identify individuals whose name appears both as an actor_name and as a student_name.</li>\n<li data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"634\">From those overlaps, keep only records where both the show_title and the course_title include the word &ldquo;magic&rdquo; (case-insensitive).</li>\n<li data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"721\">Pair each actor&rsquo;s matching performance with their corresponding course enrollment.</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"875\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">The final output should include the columns 'name', 'show_title', and 'course_title', ordered by name ascending, limited to the first five rows.</p>",
        "schema": "CREATE TABLE performances (\n  performance_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  actor_name VARCHAR(100),\n  show_title VARCHAR(100)\n);\nCREATE TABLE enrollments (\n  enrollment_id INT PRIMARY KEY,\n  student_name VARCHAR(100),\n  course_title VARCHAR(100)\n);\nINSERT INTO performances VALUES\n  (101, 'Faye Storm',   'Magic & Mystery'),\n  (102, 'Gus Cairn',    'Epic Adventure'),\n  (103, 'Hana Grove',   'Magic Ensemble'),\n  (104, 'Ivy Cross',    'Poetry Night'),\n  (105, 'Jax Monroe',   'Magic Under Moonlight');\nINSERT INTO enrollments VALUES\n  (101, 'Faye Storm',   'Magic Foundations'),\n  (102, 'Gus Cairn',    'Adventure Writing'),\n  (103, 'Hana Grove',   'Magic Performance'),\n  (104, 'Ivy Cross',    'Creative Storytelling'),\n  (105, 'Jax Monroe',   'Magic Illusions');\n\n",
